w little things to change and to fix  and I'm really excited to see the  changes that onward puts out to see if  that fixes my occlusion issues and it  might even fix this top sensor issue  that would be really nice when they  change Dax that's what goes haywire is  like my character doesn't but my hands  get all messed up because of this top  sensor so we'll see how that goes and  maybe I'll post a follow-up at some  point but my initial thoughts on this  headset is yeah it's amazing  III love it I love it so very cool very  excited to continue playing with it very  happy with it so anyways  sponsored in any way either I will put a  link in the description to the headset  on Amazon now and if you are interested  you could buy it through that link and  I'll get a little bit of a kickback from  Amazon but I really just bought it for  myself and I'm super happy so anyways  those are my thoughts I'll see you guys  later

